  "properties": {
    "require_edit_to_continue": "false",
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Turn customer traits on and off. How does each trait affect the prediction?\r\n- Combine different traits. How do these combinations affect the prediction?\r\n- Be prepared to answer a question about how the model works.",
